Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:02:25.20,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 女单半决赛
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:25.20,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}莱巴金娜 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}4 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 高芙 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:02.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Elena,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:04.48,EN,,0,0,0,,what an incredible match you just played
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:04.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,你刚打了一场了不起的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:08.80,EN,,0,0,0,,to send yourself to your first US Open final.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:08.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,把自己送进了首个美网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:10.96,EN,,0,0,0,,After the first set,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:10.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,输掉首盘之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:13.12,EN,,0,0,0,,how were you able to reset and come out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:13.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是怎么重整旗鼓
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.12,0:00:15.04,EN,,0,0,0,,and play such good tennis in the second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.12,0:00:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,在第二盘和第三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:16.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and third?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:16.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,打出这么好的网球的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:20.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I feel like first set it was still a good start,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:20.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得首盘开局其实不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:22.56,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, it was just one break
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:22.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是被破了一个发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:26.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and of course there is nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:26.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然也会紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:28.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Koko, she is a great player.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:28.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,高芙是很出色的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:30.80,EN,,0,0,0,,It's always tough to play against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:30.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟她打总是很难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:31.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Even
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:31.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,就算
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:32.80,EN,,0,0,0,,if sometimes her first serve doesn't go,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:32.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候她一发进不去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:34.00,EN,,0,0,0,,the second one is so heavy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:34.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,二发也非常有力量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:37.12,EN,,0,0,0,,that it's difficult to dictate the rallies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,很难主导回合
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:40.64,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah, I just took a deep breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:40.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就是深吸了一口气
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:42.96,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, was trying to talk positive
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,试着跟自己说些正面的话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:45.84,EN,,0,0,0,,with myself and just told myself that I need
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:45.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后告诉自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.84,0:00:49.84,EN,,0,0,0,,to fight and try to show good tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.84,0:00:49.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,必须去拼 打出好网球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.84,0:00:52.88,EN,,0,0,0,,In the third, you served for the match,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.84,0:00:52.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,第三盘你有一个发球胜赛局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.88,0:00:54.96,EN,,0,0,0,,got broken, and came back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.88,0:00:54.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,被破了 然后你又回来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:00:57.68,EN,,0,0,0,,and played an incredible return game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:00:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,打了一个精彩的接发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:00:59.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Did you lose any confidence at 5-3
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.68,0:00:59.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,5-3的时候你动摇过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:01.44,EN,,0,0,0,,or were you still pretty confident
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:01.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是一直都有信心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.44,0:01:03.76,EN,,0,0,0,,at your abilities to return at 5-4?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.44,0:01:03.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,5-4时能破掉她的发球？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.76,0:01:05.36,EN,,0,0,0,,It was such a close set
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.76,0:01:05.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,那一盘太接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:09.20,EN,,0,0,0,,and I feel like I got a little bit lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:09.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得自己有点运气
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:11.04,EN,,0,0,0,,on this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,就那么一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:14.16,EN,,0,0,0,,on her serve couple deep returns,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:14.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,她的发球局 几个很深的回球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:15.20,EN,,0,0,0,,one mistake from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:15.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,她出现一次失误
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:16.64,EN,,0,0,0,,It went quickly my way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:16.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,局面很快就转向我这边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:19.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and then I know you guys wanted Koko
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:19.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道你们都想让高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.36,0:01:22.16,EN,,0,0,0,,to win and I think it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.36,0:01:22.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,赢下这场球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:24.00,EN,,0,0,0,,was a real battle and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:24.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得那是一场真正的苦战
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:26.88,EN,,0,0,0,,as I said few moments really it went my way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:26.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像我说的 几个瞬间倒向了我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.88,0:01:30.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and in the end I mean I was just trying
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.88,0:01:30.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后我只是努力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.72,0:01:33.12,EN,,0,0,0,,to still be focused try to stay aggressive
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.72,0:01:33.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,保持专注 保持侵略性
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.12,0:01:36.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and somehow won the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.12,0:01:36.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后就这么赢下了比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:38.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Well well great job in winning the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:38.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,祝贺你赢下这场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:41.04,EN,,0,0,0,,In the final,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:41.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,决赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:43.20,EN,,0,0,0,,you will face a familiar opponent
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:43.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会遇到一位熟悉的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.20,0:01:46.32,EN,,0,0,0,,in a Grand Slam final in Aryna Sabalenka.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.20,0:01:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,大满贯决赛的对手萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.32,0:01:47.12,EN,,0,0,0,,What are your thoughts
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.32,0:01:47.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你怎么看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.12,0:01:50.96,EN,,0,0,0,,on that upcoming incredible women's final?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.12,0:01:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,即将到来的这场女单决赛？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.96,0:01:51.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.96,0:01:51.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.28,0:01:54.40,EN,,0,0,0,,she's I mean she's unbelievable player
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.28,0:01:54.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,她是难以置信的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.40,0:01:56.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and she was playing really well today,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.40,0:01:56.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天她打得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.40,0:01:57.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I feel like.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.40,0:01:57.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是这么觉得的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:02:00.24,EN,,0,0,0,,And I definitely need to step
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:02:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我肯定需要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.24,0:02:02.64,EN,,0,0,0,,my game up serve much better,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.24,0:02:02.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,把状态提上去 发球要好得多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.64,0:02:04.88,EN,,0,0,0,,start to serve much better than today
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.64,0:02:04.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,要比今天发得好得多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.88,0:02:08.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and stay aggressive go for the shots
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.88,0:02:08.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,保持侵略性 去搏那些球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:09.36,EN,,0,0,0,,because I know whenever you get
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:09.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我知道 只要有机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.36,0:02:12.00,EN,,0,0,0,,opportunity you need to really go
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.36,0:02:12.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你就必须真的去搏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:14.56,EN,,0,0,0,,for your shots especially
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:14.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,去搏你的球 特别是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.56,0:02:15.36,EN,,0,0,0,,with Aryna.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.56,0:02:15.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,面对萨巴伦卡的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:17.52,EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah just try to enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:17.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以就是试着去享受
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.52,0:02:19.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I think I did maximum on this tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.52,0:02:19.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得这站我已经做到极限了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:22.08,EN,,0,0,0,,already especially doubting
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,特别是之前还怀疑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:23.68,EN,,0,0,0,,if I'm going to be able to play here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:23.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己能不能来这儿打
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:26.70,EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, I just tried to enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:26.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我就是试着享受
